# Terraform local working files — never committed. The lockfile
# (.terraform.lock.hcl) IS committed (provider pinning, ADR-038);
# everything else here is per-operator scratch or, worse, live state.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
# Plan files serialize full resource values + a copy of state. Cover the
# common `-out=` names too — and prefer never using `-out` at all.
*.tfplan
tfplan
plan.out
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Per-operator variable overrides stay local (credentials discipline:
# secrets come from SCW_*/AWS_* env vars, never tfvars).
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
